      "text":"End-to-end encryption (E2EE): your prompt is encrypted on your device and opens only inside that sealed hardware... so only you and the AI can read it.\n\nUploads, web search and memory features are not available through E2EE.\n\nUse it for what's only yours, like a journal. https://t.co/GTnaSnuwEH"
